# ── Google Sign-In setup (done inside Firebase Console) ───────
# No separate OAuth credentials needed — Firebase handles it.
# Steps:
#  1. Go to Firebase Console > Authentication > Sign-in method
#  2. Enable "Google" as a sign-in provider
#  3. Add your app domain to Authorized domains
#     (e.g. localhost, yourdomain.com)
#  4. That's it — Firebase uses your project's OAuth client automatically.
